      "sourceUrl": "https://www.aquariumglaser.de/en/02-living-fossils/polypterus-ansorgii/",
      "html": "<p>Only two specimens of this bichir were received – the rarest of all bichir species. The currently imported specimens are 15-20 cm long. The species can reach a maximum length of about 80 cm and is thus the largest of all known Polypterus species.</p>"
    },
    {
