      "source": "glaser",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.aquariumglaser.de/en/02-living-fossils/polypterus-ansorgii/",
      "html": "<p>Origin: Guinea.</p>"
    },
    {
      "key": "notes",
      "source": "glaser",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.aquariumglaser.de/en/02-living-fossils/polypterus-ansorgii/",
      "html": "<p>A German article on the species appeared in the current issue of Aqualog/Terralog News, which will be available in English in September.</p><p>Lexicon: ansorgii: dedication name for William John Ansorge (1850-1913).</p>"
    }
